        "description": "Owned production stockpile or standalone warehouse. A paid expansion adds one item slot. Price is base_price * (capacity - initial_capacity + 1). Default base 5 Cr; production 4 to 40 slots, warehouse 20 to 200. Admin may configure price and limit without granting slots. Optional personal top-up fills the exact budget shortfall. Payment reaches settlement treasury atomically with capacity change; replay cannot double-charge."
